  OWN-WORLD: EVSuite tonal panes, one outline, one radius, Roboto readouts, no shadow or motion.
  STORY: read the route the car already knows, then the charge it leaves you with, then why.
  FIRST VIEWPORT: fixed top context and Back action; the arrival figure owns the centre.
